ite one word","A call plugs in values and gets a result: shorter code, and each part can be tested separately","A function has parameters (input) and a result (return); big programs are built from small functions"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":50.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def area(r):","    return 3.14 * r * r"],"hl":[0],"lang":"python","size":12.0,"lh":24.0,"w":260.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":50.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["a = area(2)    # 12.56","b = area(10)   # 314.0","print(a + b)"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"python","size":12.0,"lh":24.0,"w":260.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"i","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"input: r = 2","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"area(r)","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"12.56","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":96.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":226.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":260.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[12.6,25.7]}]},{"title":"Classes","sub":"A blueprint for objects","main":"A class describes attributes and methods; objects are made from the blueprint.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Blueprint","Objects","Methods"],"captions":["A class is a blueprint: every dog has a name and an age, and can bark","Objects come from the blueprint: Sharik and Rex are two dogs with different data","An object's data are attributes, its actions are methods; in Python almost everything is an object, even numbers and functions"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":40.0,"y":28.0,"lines":["class Dog:","    def __init__(self, name):","        self.name = name","    def speak(self):","        return self.name + \": woof\""],"lang":"python","size":9.5,"lh":17.0,"w":290.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"class Dog","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"s